, making it a versatile tool for multimodal AI experiments.","zh":"DFN5B-CLIP-ViT-H-14-378 是一个视觉语言模型，通过联合学习图像和文本表示，解决跨模态理解难题。其核心在于利用50亿规模的多样化图像-文本对进行训练，提升了模型对复杂视觉概念和语义描述的泛化能力。开发者可将其用于零样本图像分类、图文检索等任务，或基于其嵌入特征进行微调，适用于内容审核、智能搜索等实际场景，为多模态AI研究提供强大基础。","es":"DFN5B-CLIP-ViT-H-14-378 is a vision-language model that bridges images and text, enabling applications like zero-shot image classification and cross-modal retrieval. Its technical innovation lies in training on a massive, diverse dataset of 5 billion image-text pairs, which enhances its ability to understand nuanced visual concepts and textual descriptions. Researchers can fine-tune it for specific domains or use its embeddings directly for tasks like visual question answering and content moderation, making it a versatile tool for multimodal AI experiments."},"provider":{"name":"deepseek-tri","version":"1.0.0","mode":"json_single"},"quality":{"score":0.92,"fallback":false,"length":{"en":563,"zh":178,"es":563},"warnings":["es_short:0"],"accepted_at":"2026-03-04T03:26:15.785Z"}}
{"schema_version":1,"pipeline_version":"v6","run_id":"data-analysis-2026-03-04-20260304033028.-30425c82","generated_at":"2026-03-04T03:30:28.577Z","canonical_id":"huggingface:amazon/chronos-t5-base","promptHash":"sha256:64bf777d314db6e6a8d6e060f07e492b078bef38c08dc00507e79f3a93288f26","summary_version":1,"status":"qualified","source":"huggingface","name":"chronos-t5-base","url":"https://huggingface.co/amazon/chronos-t5-base","tags":["chronos-forecasting","safetensors","t5","time series","forecasting","pretrained models","foundation models","time series foundation models","time-series","time-series-forecasting","arxiv:2403.07815","arxiv:1910.10683","license:apache-2.0","region:us"],"stats":{"downloads_total":2780722,"likes_total":41},"metadata":{"license":"N/A","lang":"N/A","categories":{"capabilities":[],"scenes":[],"lifecycle":[]}},"summary_short":{"zh":"Chronos-T5-base 是一个时间序列基础模型，它将预测任务转化为语言建模问题，使非专业用户也能轻松进行时间序列分析。该模型通过将连续数值数据离散化为词汇标记，并利用T5架构的编码器-解码器框架进行序列生成，实现了跨领域的统一预测能力。开发者可基于特定数据集微调以获得定制化预测模型，或直接使用其零样本能力快速测试不同场景的应用潜力，如零售销量预测或工业设备维护预警。","en":"Chronos-T5-base is a time series foundation model that transforms forecasting into a language modeling task, making it accessible without specialized statistical expertise. It tokenizes numerical time series data into discrete tokens and leverages the T5 architecture to generate…","es":"Chronos-T5-base is a time series foundation model that transforms forecasting into a language modeling task, making it accessible without specialized statistical expertise. It tokenizes numerical time series data into discrete tokens and leverages the T5 architecture to generate…"},"summaries":{"en":"Chronos-T5-base is a time series foundation model that transforms forecasting into a language modeling task, making it accessible without specialized statistical expertise. It tokenizes numerical time series data into discrete tokens and leverages the T5 architecture to generate future sequences through next-token prediction. Researchers can fine-tune it on custom datasets for domain-specific forecasting, while practitioners can use its zero-shot capabilities for quick prototyping across diverse applications like energy demand or financial trend analysis.","zh":"Chronos-T5-base 是一个时间序列基础模型，它将预测任务转化为语言建模问题，使非专业用户也能轻松进行时间序列分析。该模型通过将连续数值数据离散化为词汇标记，并利用T5架构的编码器-解码器框架进行序列生成，实现了跨领域的统一预测能力。开发者可基于特定数据集微调以获得定制化预测模型，或直接使用其零样本能力快速测试不同场景的应用潜力，如零售销量预测或工业设备维护预警。","es":"Chronos-T5-base is a time series foundation model that transforms forecasting into a language modeling task, making it accessible without specialized statistical expertise. It tokenizes numerical time series data into discrete tokens and leverages the T5 architecture to generate future sequences through next-token prediction. Researchers can fine-tune it on custom datasets for domain-specific forecasting, while practitioners can use its zero-shot capabilities for quick prototyping across diverse applications like energy demand or financial trend analysis."},"provider":{"name":"deepseek-tri","version":"1.0.0","mode":"json_single"},"quality":{"score":0.92,"fallback":false,"length":{"en":561,"zh":188,"es":561},"warnings":["es_short:0"],"accepted_at":"2026-03-04T03:26:15.785Z"}}
